+        // (read DELTAS).
+        //   serve_off / request_off   the calibration levers AS SET (they act on the selftest role only)
+        //   armed / active / uid / script_bits / age_ms   the guest's one-shot serve now: armed by an accepted chest start, active once a
+        //                    read took it (spent the next key tick); `script_bits` the press in MY script layout (what my chest's IsButton
+        //                    tests: 0x20000 Confirm, 0x10000 Cancel under the JP scripts, 0x80000 Special); sentinels while none
+        //   accepted / served / expired / declined   the guest's chest starts: accepted (serve armed, body requested or already queued),
+        //                    served (a read took the press), expired (no read in ChestServeMs, the field changed, or replaced),
+        //                    declined (no such chest, not a stock chest model, no tag 2, no press bits, or my story not mirrored)
+        //   last_uid / why   the chest the last of those four named, and its words ("accepted" | "served" | the expiry / decline line)
+        //   selftest         null until the proof block ran, then "ok" | "fail: <row or mutant>"
+        //   host             `stamped` the chest starts this process stamped as a host; `riding` a chest start is on the lane now
